# Page objects

- Prefer the `page-object-author` skill when adding or extending page objects.
- Cypress: static classes in `cypress/pages/` — selector constants + `visit` / actions.
- Playwright: instance classes in `playwright/pages/*.page.ts` — constructor takes `Page`; `goto` / actions / `expect*`.
- Selectors use `data-testid` only (`[data-testid=…]` / `getByTestId`). Add missing test ids in product UI when needed.
- E2E and mock UI specs must go through page objects—no inline `data-testid` strings in specs.
- Keep Cypress and Playwright page objects aligned for the same screen.
